Package: highstyle
Title: Highstyle: Custom ggplot2 Theme and Utilities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Elisso", "Stamati", , "elisso.stam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: highstyle is an R package containing standardised R functions for visualising data. This way you create visually consistant plots across projects without having to repeatedly rewrite, copy, or retrieve previously used code snippets.
